# libxul, executed exit-site weight (POWERARM_NZCVEXITCENSUS=1, code cache on, fresh cache dir)
# Emulator: this tree's build of ad49fb534 + the exit-site census. Guest:
#   Firefox 156 (RootFS/ArchLinuxARM-vk-overlay/usr/lib/firefox/firefox) --headless --screenshot
#   of a local page with DOM, string, array, JSON and canvas work. POWERARM_PORTABLE=1 with an
#   absolute POWERARM_ROOTFS, so the content processes ran on this build and not the promoted stable.
# Nine processes; the rows below are their sum. Joined by nzcv-probes/nzcv_exit_weight.py;
# the raw per-process dumps follow the table.
#
# processes: 9  units: 521966  exit sites: 1108043  kept producers: 389082  site-slot overflow: 0
# executed exit traversals: 556880760
# 
# ## exit kinds: every instrumented ExitFunction bumps exactly one, so these sum to the total
# kind                        sites     traversals   share   per site
