# exit: constant and indirect-Return       n/a                            21934   5.6%    44780       38195745   6.9%       853
# exit: other                              n/a                            32528   8.4%    62336       37887891   6.8%       608
# exit: indirect-Return                    n/a                            16799   4.3%    14690       28917716   5.2%      1969
# exit: constant only                      droppable-follow-bl            21917   5.6%    34613       16098109   2.9%       465
# exit: constant and indirect-Call         n/a                            29443   7.6%    70113       15487372   2.8%       221
# exit: constant and other                 n/a                             2655   0.7%     6274        9905469   1.8%      1579
# exit: indirect-Call                      n/a                            21560   5.5%    24748        8706102   1.6%       352
# exit: constant only                      live                            3432   0.9%     5021        5312466   1.0%      1058
# exit: constant only                      dead-but-unfusable-reader        343   0.1%      574          40551   0.0%        71
# in-unit: unfusable reader (CondSubNZCV)  n/a                             8681   2.2%        0              0   0.0%         0
# in-unit: unfusable reader (other)        n/a                             1206   0.3%        0              0   0.0%         0
